                                "sense_id": "e9d7f233-dd1e-39b1-9a9e-60acee5a1db0",
                                "text": "Unless the pouches are discovered in the course of an unrelated exam, like a colonoscopy, most people with diverticulosis don’t know they have it."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
